+Please fix the Next.js prerendering build error regarding the AuthProvider context.
+
+1. Open frontend/src/app/layout.tsx and wrap the root html/body children elements inside the `<AuthProvider>` context component so that authentication context is available globally across all sub-routes during static site generation. Import AuthProvider from its correct relative path (e.g., '@/hooks/use-auth' or wherever your hook/context is exported).
+2. Clean up frontend/src/app/(dashboard)/layout.tsx by ensuring the standard `useAuth()` hook execution reads normally without temporary try/catch blocks, since the context wrapper will now live in the global root layout.
+
+Ensure all component modifications preserve original HTML structures, layouts, and Tailwind classes precisely.

